{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/d035dde1b576f819c53d2551188b356a.avif?t=1763102208\" width=591 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fist of Fate, Your Choice is the Rule</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The strongest punch will eventually strike at the most vulnerable part of fate. In this world, your choice is the only rule. The crossroads of fate have already been paved, and the outcome awaits your choice - whether to return to the pinnacle of the boxing world or sink into the maze of love? The story begins from here on, writing your own chapter in life.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/4bb3633f37542b1210fae1d431a1bb1b.poster.avif?t=1763102208\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/4bb3633f37542b1210fae1d431a1bb1b.webm?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/54044377e0610dbc5fb1baa7d169fad3.avif?t=1763102208\" width=603 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The interweaving of three threads reveals the hidden truth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The three parallel trajectories of fate in time and space, namely &quot;redemption of life&quot;, &quot;retirement of the boxing champion&quot;, and &quot;revenge in the boxing world&quot;, unfold one by one due to your choices. Is it to uncover the dark secrets and seek revenge for the departed lover, or to let go of obsession and welcome a new life? Or can we inherit our dreams in the mentorship and return to the glory arena? At the crossroads of conscience and interest, fate is determined by you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/6efffc8d4fd7e7cc8182e2dc92b63453.poster.avif?t=1763102208\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/6efffc8d4fd7e7cc8182e2dc92b63453.webm?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/6efffc8d4fd7e7cc8182e2dc92b63453.mp4?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/96dbca82aa82511aa4f6200aa1d54bbd.poster.avif?t=1763102208\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/96dbca82aa82511aa4f6200aa1d54bbd.webm?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/96dbca82aa82511aa4f6200aa1d54bbd.mp4?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/de97a651d60dee78143569f40ac9ad21.poster.avif?t=1763102208\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/de97a651d60dee78143569f40ac9ad21.webm?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/de97a651d60dee78143569f40ac9ad21.mp4?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/8de440cf6775398ef6dacee6fe08a8b6.avif?t=1763102208\" width=613 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple interactions, immersive experience of the boxing world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>600</strong> minutes of live action footage, consisting of <strong>19</strong> chapters on three main storylines and more than <strong>20</strong> endings to explore, with the entire process lasting over <strong>16</strong> hours. Players can freely choose to unlock different storylines, experience numerous human trials, witness different female lead combinations move from opposition to coexistence, and ultimately assemble into a complete truth map. The game contains rich interactive experiences: boxing competition, truth investigation, fate decision-making, and life and death escape Immersive storyline experience, taking you into a legendary boxing world where passion and emotions intertwine!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/6e45079209ce2ccccb499ee080ce9231.poster.avif?t=1763102208\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/6e45079209ce2ccccb499ee080ce9231.webm?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/6e45079209ce2ccccb499ee080ce9231.mp4?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/3955b5a5edbdebf6b851bbe1457e3078.poster.avif?t=1763102208\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/3955b5a5edbdebf6b851bbe1457e3078.webm?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/a14c65911bb45223311afa6b0a2ddf95.poster.avif?t=1763102208\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/a14c65911bb45223311afa6b0a2ddf95.webm?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/a14c65911bb45223311afa6b0a2ddf95.mp4?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/c4423c45c95b3874061cb83e121dd253.avif?t=1763102208\" width=603 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafted with ingenuity, presented with sincerity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We collaborate with a professional film and television team, using one shot to the bottom film level filming technology, and invite talented actors to star passionately, with millions of fan level guests surprised to participate. The collision of acting skills and the tension of the opposing scenes will bring you an immersive plot impact.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/47667c2101f2cabbe13f3314137cd5aa.poster.avif?t=1763102208\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/47667c2101f2cabbe13f3314137cd5aa.webm?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/47667c2101f2cabbe13f3314137cd5aa.mp4?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/444cdaf2ab5d7d5ce313073c7c292d9e.poster.avif?t=1763102208\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/444cdaf2ab5d7d5ce313073c7c292d9e.webm?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/444cdaf2ab5d7d5ce313073c7c292d9e.mp4?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/68d3f3177cb436f31de7e365f6c3481b.poster.avif?t=1763102208\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/68d3f3177cb436f31de7e365f6c3481b.webm?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/3d62001a27bdc2faa19b12f4f76de87e.avif?t=1763102208\" width=603 height=216 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Us</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends who are familiar with particles still remember our first interactive video game product &quot;Reverse 21g&quot;. As the first science fiction themed interactive video game in China, we have received a lot of support and valuable suggestions, which have become the driving force for us to continue to move forward on the road of video games. This time, we are returning with 'Can't Beat' and innovatively launching a 'parallel time and space' multi line narrative. At the same time, each storyline has added more judgment mechanisms and interactions, striving to bring everyone a richer immersive experience.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you also like this work, it will be our greatest encouragement. We will continue to improve in our future works and bring more high-quality content to everyone!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For more game information, please follow:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official Q group: 906288657</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official Tiktok: \u6211\u6253\u4e0d\u8fc7\u6f02\u4eae\u7684\u5979\u4eec</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official Bilibili: \u6211\u6253\u4e0d\u8fc7\u6f02\u4eae\u7684\u5979\u4eec</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Light in the ashes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3185890/107dc18e8f79b687e9935a01429e237921187168.jpg"},{"name":"Tit for Tat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3185890/bd97bbccdf48697d8c3500185a83ed6a6d0a31cb.jpg"},{"name":"Back to the top","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3185890/1b41f88d7f3956b0ac2804aef581fbc6523b7702.jpg"},{"name":"Mr.Powerless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3185890/4021612b4146c1c7c02af5f80e30a3086006d880.jpg"},{"name":"The hero rescues the beauty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3185890/2aec69a56ef67c3c1ec996d3f4f8a2925c1d35c6.jpg"},{"name":"Women's First Love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3185890/58977905680832858c8ca8621194f2517b25b3ee.jpg"},{"name":"Credit to All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3185890/9ccd83115d8b33d5bd5ede48336697346b882262.jpg"},{"name":"Pull of Love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3185890/f1