bout the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/d035dde1b576f819c53d2551188b356a.avif?t=1763102208\" width=591 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fist of Fate, Your Choice is the Rule</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The strongest punch will eventually strike at the most vulnerable part of fate. In this world, your choice is the only rule. The crossroads of fate have already been paved, and the outcome awaits your choice - whether to return to the pinnacle of the boxing world or sink into the maze of love? The story begins from here on, writing your own chapter in life.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/4bb3633f37542b1210fae1d431a1bb1b.poster.avif?t=1763102208\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/4bb3633f37542b1210fae1d431a1bb1b.webm?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/54044377e0610dbc5fb1baa7d169fad3.avif?t=1763102208\" width=603 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The interweaving of three threads reveals the hidden truth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The three parallel trajectories of fate in time and space, namely &quot;redemption of life&quot;, &quot;retirement of the boxing champion&quot;, and &quot;revenge in the boxing world&quot;, unfold one by one due to your choices. Is it to uncover the dark secrets and seek revenge for the departed lover, or to let go of obsession and welcome a new life? Or can we inherit our dreams in the mentorship and return to the glory arena? At the crossroads of conscience and interest, fate is determined by you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/6efffc8d4fd7e7cc8182e2dc92b63453.poster.avif?t=1763102208\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/6efffc8d4fd7e7cc8182e2dc92b63453.webm?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/6efffc8d4fd7e7cc8182e2dc92b63453.mp4?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/96dbca82aa82511aa4f6200aa1d54bbd.poster.avif?t=1763102208\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/96dbca82aa82511aa4f6200aa1d54bbd.webm?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/96dbca82aa82511aa4f6200aa1d54bbd.mp4?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/de97a651d60dee78143569f40ac9ad21.poster.avif?t=1763102208\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/de97a651d60dee78143569f40ac9ad21.webm?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/extras/de97a651d60dee78143569f40ac9ad21.mp4?t=1763102208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><i