isms and interactions, striving to bring everyone a richer immersive experience.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you also like this work, it will be our greatest encouragement. We will continue to improve in our future works and bring more high-quality content to everyone!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For more game information, please follow:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official Q group: 906288657</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official Tiktok: \u6211\u6253\u4e0d\u8fc7\u6f02\u4eae\u7684\u5979\u4eec</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Official Bilibili: \u6211\u6253\u4e0d\u8fc7\u6f02\u4eae\u7684\u5979\u4eec</strong></p>","developers":["\u60f3\u8c61\u9897\u7c92"],"dlc":[4095640],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185890/525c293d9b20508939a256e19ca1a1c19367e17f/header.jpg?t=1763102208","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3185890/465875890/84ad94acb6171d033887227c02373bb0e3466d61/1758715009/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758718956","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3185890/465875890/84ad94acb6171d033887227c02373bb0e3466d61/1758715009/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758718956","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3185890/465875890/84ad94acb6171d033887227c02373bb0e3466d61/1758715009/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758718956","id":257205399,"name":"\u5b9a\u6863PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257205399/74e783365195d95ccf318fd480d7fc7756028c83/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758718956"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3185890/408347678/f8217074e9ebeed92ab2028a5712d9aba32dc181/1750878986/dash_av1.m